<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vivra Inc reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vivra Inc reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it reinstated coverage of Vivra Inc with near-term neutral and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 32-3/4.</p>
